---
// Static decision-tree diagram — no data binding, no interactivity, so this
// is a plain Astro component rather than a D3/React island like other posts'
// Chart.tsx. Fonts/colors/spacing all come from the site's global tokens
// (src/styles/global.css) — nothing here is redefined or double-loaded.
---

<div class="full-bleed">
  <p class="scroll-hint">← scroll to see the full tree →</p>
  <div class="tree-wrap">
    <div class="tree">
      <svg class="connectors" width="900" height="500" viewBox="0 0 900 500">
        <path d="M450,110 V160 H225 V225"></path>
        <path d="M450,110 V160 H675 V225"></path>
        <path d="M225,295 V360 H110 V415"></path>
        <path d="M225,295 V360 H350 V415"></path>
        <path d="M675,295 V360 H560 V415"></path>
        <path d="M675,295 V360 H800 V415"></path>
      </svg>

      <div class="node decision" style="left:450px; top:60px;">
        Does what I'm building involve programming languages I'm fluent in?
        <span class="q-sublabel">Python / SQL / R</span>
      </div>

      <div class="node decision" style="left:225px; top:260px;">
        How long will you use what you're building for?
      </div>

      <div class="node decision" style="left:675px; top:260px;">
        Is this language/stack something I want to build fluency in?
      </div>

      <div class="branch-label" style="left:280px; top:155px;">Yes</div>
      <div class="branch-label" style="left:620px; top:155px;">No</div>

      <div class="branch-label" style="left:150px; top:355px;">Quick one-off</div>
      <div class="branch-label" style="left:305px; top:355px;">A long time</div>

      <div class="branch-label" style="left:630px; top:355px;">Yes</div>
      <div class="branch-label" style="left:770px; top:355px;">No</div>

      <div class="node end category-offload" style="left:110px; top:435px; width:150px;">
        <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Offload</span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="node end category-full" style="left:350px; top:435px; width:150px;">
        <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Fully-Involved</span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="node end category-somewhat" style="left:560px; top:435px; width:170px;">
        <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Somewhat Offload</span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="node end category-offload" style="left:800px; top:435px; width:150px;">
        <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Offload</span></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="definitions">
  <div class="def-block category-offload">
    <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Offload</span></span>
    <ol>
      <li>Chat with Claude to reach a shared understanding of the problem</li>
      <li>Turn the conversation into README.md + CLAUDE.md</li>
      <li>Hand both off to Claude Code to execute</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="def-block category-somewhat">
    <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Somewhat Offload</span></span>
    <ol>
      <li>Chat with Claude to reach a shared understanding of the problem</li>
      <li>Explore trade-offs between different approaches, researching academic papers + company blogs</li>
      <li>Handwritten notes of different approaches + what I learned</li>
      <li>Turn the conversation into README.md + CLAUDE.md</li>
      <li>Hand off to Claude Code to execute</li>
      <li>Pick a part I'm curious about, understand it at a fundamental level + code from scratch</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="def-block category-full">
    <span class="highlight"><span class="end-header">Fully-Involved</span></span>
    <p class="def-rationale">For these, coding lets me actually think + struggle with the problem — that wouldn't happen otherwise. No struggle = no later understanding.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Chat with Claude to reach a shared understanding of the problem</li>
      <li>Design the system by hand on paper</li>
      <li>Figure out what is the most minimal version I can deliver</li>
      <li>Turn the conversation into README.md + CLAUDE.md</li>
      <li>Manually create the folder structure</li>
      <li>Manually create the initial skeleton code</li>
      <li>Build the minimal version</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="never-offloaded">
  <h2>Never Offloaded</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>EDA</li>
    <li>Preprocessing — cleaning, outlier / missing-value judgment calls</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<style>
  .scroll-hint {
    display: none;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .scroll-hint {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .tree-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }

  .tree {
    position: relative;
    width: 900px;
    height: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  svg.connectors {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .connectors path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .node {
    position: absolute;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .node.decision {
    width: 220px;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .node.decision .q-sublabel {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .node.end {
    width: 190px;
  }

  .node.end .highlight {
    display: block;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .node.end .end-header {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  /* Offload = green (olive) */
  .node.end.category-offload .highlight,
  .def-block.category-offload .highlight {
    background: rgba(91, 107, 62, 0.1);
  }
  .node.end.category-offload .end-header,
  .def-block.category-offload .end-header {
    color: var(--color-olive);
  }

  /* Fully-involved = red (terracotta) */
  .node.end.category-full .highlight,
  .def-block.category-full .highlight {
    background: rgba(182, 108, 83, 0.1);
  }
  .node.end.category-full .end-header,
  .def-block.category-full .end-header {
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
  }

  /* Somewhat offload = yellow (wheat-gold) */
  .node.end.category-somewhat .highlight,
  .def-block.category-somewhat .highlight {
    background: rgba(169, 134, 62, 0.1);
  }
  .node.end.category-somewhat .end-header,
  .def-block.category-somewhat .end-header {
    color: var(--color-wheat-gold);
  }

  .branch-label {
    position: absolute;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    padding: 0 6px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .definitions {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .def-block {
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .def-block:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .def-block .highlight {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .def-block .def-rationale {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .def-block ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .def-block li {
    position: relative;
    counter-increment: step;
    padding-left: 30px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .def-block li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .def-block li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .never-offloaded {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .never-offloaded h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-marker);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .never-offloaded ul {
    list-style: disc;
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .never-offloaded li {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .never-offloaded li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
